{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nfrom math import isqrt\n\ndef read_ints():\n    return list(map(int, input().split()))\n\ndef ceil_div(a, b):\n    return (a + b - 1) // b\n\ndef add_mod(a, b):\n    return (a + b) % mod\n\ndef mul_mod(a, b):\n    return (a * b) % mod\n\nn, mod = read_ints()\nmem = [0, 1]\ntotal_sum = 1\n\nfor i in range(2, n + 1):\n    sqrt_i = isqrt(i)\n    current = total_sum\n\n    for f in range(2, sqrt_i + 1):\n        current = add_mod(current, mem[i // f])\n\n    prev_bound = i\n    for j in range(1, i // (sqrt_i + 1) + 1):\n        next_bound = i // (j + 1)\n        current = add_mod(current, mul_mod(prev_bound - next_bound, mem[j]))\n        prev_bound = next_bound\n\n    total_sum = add_mod(total_sum, current)\n    mem.append(current)\n\nprint(mem[-1])\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static long mod;\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long n = sc.nextLong();\n        mod = sc.nextLong();\n        \n        long[] mem = new long[(int)n + 1];\n        mem[0] = 0;\n        mem[1] = 1;\n        long total_sum = 1;\n        \n        for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {\n            int sqrt_i = (int)Math.sqrt(i);\n            long current = total_sum;\n            \n            for (int f = 2; f <= sqrt_i; f++) {\n                current = add_mod(current, mem[i / f]);\n            }\n            \n            int prev_bound = i;\n            for (int j = 1; j <= i / (sqrt_i + 1); j++) {\n                int next_bound = i / (j + 1);\n                current = add_mod(current, mul_mod((long)(prev_bound - next_bound), mem[j]));\n                prev_bound = next_bound;\n            }\n            \n            total_sum = add_mod(total_sum, current);\n            mem[i] = current;\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(mem[(int)n]);\n    }\n    \n    static long add_mod(long a, long b) {\n        return (a + b) % mod;\n    }\n    \n    static long mul_mod(long a, long b) {\n        return (a * b) % mod;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-7.331102824537084e-05, -1.311301275563892e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.7656173188006505e-05, -1.4662635294371285e-05, -0.023331398144364357, -0.05858268588781357, -2.9205850296420977e-05, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -2.3483953555114567e-05, -0.03804256021976471, -7.509902934543788e-05, -0.045368071645498276, -0.2020653337240219, -0.00023338454775512218, -0.0977061465382576, -6.556489552167477e-06, -0.014272278174757957, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -0.008926013484597206, -1.3947389561508317e-05, -5.960462772236497e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -3.111314072157256e-05, -5.960462772236497e-07, -2.3841830625315197e-06, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -3.349725011503324e-05, -0.10059323161840439, -4.6491513785440475e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -6.437280717364047e-06, -3.814689989667386e-06, -2.145764938177308e-06, -1.1444026313256472e-05, -5.3642743296